# Refactoring Rules

- Small, isolated PRs. One responsibility per PR.
- Keep **public APIs** stable; if changed, update `docs/ADR-*.md` and `docs/api-contracts.md`.
- Write migration notes & scripts when touching models/schemas.
- Provide before/after examples in PR description.
